{"server":"en","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_08_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_08","title":"Gavial's Fist","storyCode":"RI-8","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"3750042045ecd7bb4d75e1c32dbededbbc521e3bee9e5de762bc7249f5f906eb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Waaaaahhhh! Ugh, hold on. I should do a different cry next time, I'm getting rather tired of this one..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, is he alright?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"No need to worry, he'll be back in a minute."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay... is he like... a person? I've never heard of anyone like him before."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"No idea, the High Priest only told me he's lived here for a very long time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright then. What else can we say..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew, he's really something..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Gavial, your head is bleeding. Are you okay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine, just a scratch. Tomimi, bring me my medical bag here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm? Where did Tomimi go?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Utage","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"Here's your bag. And Tomimi, I think I saw her running off somewhere right before we won the fight."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Thanks. She didn't get scared, did she? Anyway, let's patch ourselves up first."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"You go check if anyone's injured, and bring them to me if they are. I'll take care of them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceobe","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"Leave it to me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Haha, no problem."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Utage","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh, what a pain. Fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Quit yer belly-achin'."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor... hmm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"The Big Ugly..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, Zumama. We had to take it apart."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"I know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"I checked your engine, I think it's working fine. You can have it back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh yeah? That's great!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"You really won't stay, Gavial?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, just like you, I've found my calling."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"To be a doctor?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"That's it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Is doctoring fun?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Is building machines fun?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"It is."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Same here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"But you still have to be the Great Chief."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Any way you slice it, you beat the Big, Ugly Thing. You won, Gavial."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Look, everyone's here again. They're looking to you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch. Doctor, what do we do?"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Your call.","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"You're not giving me anything here!"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, I know you're awake! I'm a doctor!"}]},{"label":"All hail Great Chief Gavial!","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch. Doctor, I really want to punch you right now."}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"Gavial, are you hurt?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm? I'm fine. Where did you run off to?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? Oh, that... I had to go pee!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay... Hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"What's wrong, Gavial? Why are you looking at me like that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm... Haha, I've got it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, listen up!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"I beat the Big Ugly, so I'm going to be the Great Chief."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"And so, my message to you is——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Your fists are everything!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh? Gavial, are you staying here to be the Great Chief?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"But!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"I have something very important I must do, so I have to leave."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Worry not, though! When I'm gone, Tomimi will give orders on my behalf!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Just treat Tomimi as you would treat me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh, w-w-what?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Utage","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"Is that really gonna fly? Don't these people worship strength over everything?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Gavial is the Great Chief after all. She defeated everyone, so her word is law."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Haha. Zumama, machines are pretty cool, but I think I'll stick with my fists after all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph. Don't forget, I still don't recognize you. I'll build an even greater machine and challenge you again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure, I'll be waiting."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, right. Before that, you need to come with me for a bit."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Why?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"You need to come with me to Rhodes Island to get an Oripathy checkup."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Can I refuse? I still have to work on the Big Ugly..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't have a choice this time. Besides, until Tomimi takes over, I'm still the Great Chief. I'll bring you back even if I have to kidnap you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"...Gavial, are you going to leave after all?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Yep, I'll probably be leaving right as soon as we get the engine back in the aircraft."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"No."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tomimi","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"I-I won't let you leave!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["Blaze"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["Gavial"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["Croissant"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["Ceobe"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["Utage"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["Tomimi"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["Eunectes"]}]}
